      r: ['Correct. Also every 4 hours and after any interruption; give drugs separately.', 'Incorrect. Small syringes create high pressure that can rupture the tube.', 'Incorrect. Flush between drugs — mixing them causes clogs.', 'Incorrect. Too infrequent.'],
      ask: 'What prevents clogs and tube rupture?', cues: ['Several medications'],
